    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]Soon as the [G]evening shades [D]prevail,",
        "[D]The moon [G]takes up [C]the [Am]wondrous [G/D]tale;",
        "[D7]And nightly to [G/B]the listening [D7/F#]earth",
