        "[D]And all [G]the planets [Am]in [G/D]their [D7]turn,",
        "[D7]Confirm the [D/A]tidings [D7/F#]as [C]they roll,",
        "[D7]And spread the [G]truth from [D]pole to pole"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]What though [G]in solemn silence [D]all",
        "[D]Move round [G]the dark [C]terrestrial [D7]ball?",
